<sect1 id="tensor__cast_8dox_1tensor_cast_intro">
<title>tensor_cast.h</title><para>The <computeroutput>tensor_cast.h</computeroutput> header contains template logic used to safely rebuild N-dimensional <computeroutput>torch::Tensor</computeroutput> objects from nested C++ <computeroutput>std::vector</computeroutput> types. This is effectively the inverse operation to <computeroutput>vector_cast.h</computeroutput>, primarily used when reconstructing tensors from ROOT event buffers. </para>
</sect1>
